        <mxCell id="ontologyNote" value="&lt;b&gt;Ontological interpretation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The disaster is modeled as E5 Event. Its presence with the monument is expressed by P12. The impact is not a non-CIDOC relation: it is the E3 Condition State identified by an E14 Condition Assessment after the event. The response is an E11 Modification, carried out by an E39 Actor, modifying the monument and motivated by the documented condition." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9ca3af;dashed=1;fontColor=#374151;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
